-    $$ L_{color} = \frac{1}{\#R} \sum_{r \in R} \| M(r) (\hat{C}(r) - C(r)) \|_1 $$
-    where $R$ is the ray set constructed from all images, $C(r)$ is ground truth color, and $M(r)$ is the ground truth object mask [S2].
